Ravana

Daemons
Shade - Demons that have passed into the physical world without their form. They rarely have a specific attribute and simply prioritise feeding on suffering
Greater Demons - Demons that have grown powerful enough to split themselves into lesser demons that serve it loyally
Lesser demons - Demons that have grown powerful enough to take 'form' in the aether by feeding on the wandering souls or wandering the physical world as a shade
Kobolds - Lesser imps, lacking power and intelligence that act as bottom feeders. work in packs, exceptionally rutheless and can survive in the physical realm for years without constant ritual magic. as a result they often infest fonts of magic or abandoned holy sites en masse

        ->  Seraphim    ->  Lesser Angels   ->  Divine Angels
Denizen
        ->  Demons      ->  Lesser Demons   ->  Greater Demons
        ->  Kobolds     ->  Imps

