PROMETHEUS INITITATIVE
Discovered what happens to a human after death (soul goes to the aether)


GOALS:
 - Figure out how to control and manipulate the Aether
 - Build a new eternal utopia inside the aether (Elysium)
 - Eternal life after death

Means:
 - Capture of Magical races/creatures/items for study
 - Testing means to survive the aether on unwilling subjects


This is a message.
Part a system of messages.
Pay attention to it!

Sending this message was important to us.
We considered ourselves to be powerful.

This place is not a place of honour.
No esteemed deed is commemorated here.
Nothing valued is here.

What is here was dangerous and repulsive to us.
This message is a warning about danger.

The danger is in a particular location.
The center of danger is here.
The danger is still present, in your time, as it was in ours.

The danger is to the body, and it can kill. 
The danger is unleashed only if you substantially disturb this place physically.
This place is best shunned and left uninhabited.


