ROAK
"only on our terms"
A cunning ambush and assasination race

Formed into clans of various sizes, loyalty within the clan is absolutebut between clans are constant wars and rivalries

Only rule all clans obey is that the surface must never learn the roak exist

roak warrens
-Retractable ladders to allow roak to retreat to higher ground
-Rope that allows swinging or climbing to safety that can be cut if players try to follow
-use of status effects, difficult terrain, poisoned weapons, disease
-Bridges strong enough for a roak but collapses under heavier weight of other creatures, often above pitfalls or spikes
-strong reliance on darkness, provide lit paths and attack from hidden areas in the darkness
-Reliance on ranged weapons or quick melee hit and run
-oil barrels rolled down ramps set on fire
-Heavy barrels rolled down to break supports and drop attackser into pits
-roak will lure attackers into ambush after ambush



LYRA VITAE
fem
silver eyes
Raised by M and F amongst humans on earth, lyra grew up friendly and outgoing with a strong curiosity, she lived on earth for many years until her mothers 'death' and the global apocalypse forced her to leave
Lyra left her father to find her own way in the world, travelling from town to town as an adventurer before joining the vindictis confederation and raising through the ranks to captain
Respected captain in the vindictis, spent most of her career hunting the knight commando and a small portion fighting the scourge, eventually married Arlyss and left the vindictis to again become an adventurer

Arlyss Knight
